WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.700
A poster can go through several rounds before it’s ready.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.100
Byturn keeps the artwork, feedback, and approval together.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:13.767
The studio uploads a version and shares a review link.

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:17.267
Clients can open it without creating an account.

00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:21.933
Pin a comment to the exact spot that needs attention.

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:25.133
Each note stays with its image and version.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.867
When the revised artwork is ready, approve that version.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:34.400
The review locks, and the original stays available to download.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:39.167
Try the Northline project in the interactive demo.
